<title>USA: Infoseek names Motro president.</title>
<headline>Infoseek names Motro president.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA CLARA, Calif 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Infoseek Corp said it named Harry Motro, 36,  president.</p>
<p>Motro joins Infoseek after three years with CNN where he founded CNN Interactive, one of the Internet's most successful Web sites.</p>
<p>Motro will report to chief executive Robin Johnson, who formerly also held the title of president, and be responsible for sales, marketing, public relations, engineering, product management and legal.</p>
